        "reason": "参与人列表小节，提供发言者角色证据"
      },
      {
        "signal": {
          "kind": "literal_phrase",
          "value": "Prepared Remarks",
          "field": null
        },
        "location": "body",
        "reason": "管理层准备发言小节"
      },
      {
        "signal": {
          "kind": "literal_phrase",
          "value": "Question-and-Answer",
          "field": null
        },
        "location": "body",
        "reason": "分析师问答小节"
      }
    ],
    "counterexamples": [
      "第三方平台的编辑摘要/takeaways/术语表不是管理层发言，不得当管理层原话",
      "分析师问题中的数字与假设是提问者内容，须绑定问句与发言人",
      "网站抓取件的来源是聚合平台（如 transcript 站点），原始披露是公司新闻稿/8-K，来源角色要分开",
      "constant currency 等全局限定语随局部事实一起保留",
      "Operator/主持人串词不含业务事实"
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "role": "management_discussion",
      "aliases": [
        "Prepared Remarks",
        "开场发言",
        "management remarks"
      ],
      "heading_path": [
        [
          "Full Conference Call Transcript",
          "Prepared Remarks",
          "开场"
        ],
        [
          "Prepared Remarks"
        ]
      ],
      "priority": 1,
      "questions": [
        "管理层准备发言中的业务事实与展望",
        "发言人角色（CEO/CFO）"
      ],
      "geometry_intent": {
        "discover": "context_only",
        "fine": "explicit_only",
        "demand_class": "context"
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "questions",
      "aliases": [
        "Q&A",
        "Question-and-Answer",
        "Questions and Answers",
        "问答"
      ],
      "heading_path": [
        [
          "Q&A",
          "Question-and-Answer",
          "Questions and Answers"
        ]
      ],
      "priority": 1,
      "questions": [
        "问答对绑定：分析师问题 vs 管理层回答",
        "管理层对问题前提的修正/否定"
      ],
      "geometry_intent": {
        "discover": "context_only",
        "fine": "explicit_only",
        "demand_class": "context"
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "outlook",
      "aliases": [
        "Guidance",
